# Start Here
**👋 Welcome to Ordinate**

A connected planning workbook for Acme Manufacturing. Edit an input on the left to update the live results on the right—and the other five sheets.

**Try it:** double-click 12,000,000 and enter 15000000. Watch 2027 revenue become 16,200,000. Select a result to inspect its formula.

| @meta |  || {::>} |  | {:,.0f} {::>,bold} |
|  | Input || Value | Live result | Result |
|  | --- || --- | --- | --- |
|  | Annual revenue || 12000000 {:,.0f} | 2027 revenue | = @["Annual revenue","Value"] * (1 + @["Revenue growth","Value"]) |
|  | Revenue growth || 0.08 {:.1%} | Revenue increase | = @["Annual revenue","Value"] * @["Revenue growth","Value"] |
|  | Gross margin || 0.48 {:.1%} | 2027 gross profit | = @["Annual revenue","Result"] * @["Gross margin","Value"] |
|  | Corporate tax || 0.25 {:.1%} | 2026 net income | = @["Review"::["2026 net income","Value"]] |
|  | Loan principal || 300000 {:,.0f} | Monthly payment | = -pmt(@["Loan annual rate","Value"] / 12, @["Loan years","Value"] * 12, @["Loan principal","Value"]) {:,.2f} |
|  | Loan annual rate || 0.048 {:.2%} | First-year interest | = @["Review"::["First-year loan interest","Value"]] {:,.2f} |
|  | Loan years || 30 | First-year principal | = @["Review"::["First-year principal repaid","Value"]] {:,.2f} |
|  | Hourly rate || 125 {:,.2f} | Billable service fees | = sum(@["Delivery Sessions"::H2:H17]) {:,.2f} |
|  | Sales tax || 0.10 {:.1%} | Open invoice value | = sum(filter(@["Sales Ledger"::H2:H25], @["Sales Ledger"::I2:I25] == "Open")) {:,.2f} |

**🧭 Explore the workbook**

- **Operating Report:** grouped rows, two-level headers and formats shared by a whole row or column.
- **Sales Ledger:** dates, invoice arithmetic and a larger working table.
- **Loan Planner:** payment, interest and principal calculations driven by these inputs.
- **Delivery Sessions:** elapsed durations, billable time and conditional formulas.
- **Review:** results linked across sheets, filtering and lookup.

Use the row and column rails to select, format or reorganize data. Switch to Source mode to see this entire workbook as readable text. Undo lets you experiment safely.

These notes are editable too: double-click to write, Enter starts a paragraph, Shift+Enter inserts a line break, and Command+Enter or Ctrl+Enter confirms. Save an Ordinate copy to keep your work, or export to Excel. All companies and figures in this workbook are fictional; amounts are dollars.

# Operating Report
**Acme Manufacturing | half-year operating review, 2025–2027**

Amounts are dollars. The six periods include the prior year, the current plan and the next-year forecast. The 2026 plan uses Annual revenue from Start Here; the 2027 forecast uses Revenue growth.

**Try it:** collapse Revenue or Cost of sales using the green arrow. The repeated year labels form a single header over each pair of half-years. Select a total row and open its Format or Style menu from the row rail.

