Gross margin is a row-wide percentage format, while the period columns share number formatting and right alignment. Header labels stay centered. This illustrates the format cascade without repeating formatting in every cell.

# Sales Ledger
**Acme Manufacturing | customer invoices, January–June 2026**

This ledger is independent of the operating forecast. Each line shows an invoice before and after Sales tax from Start Here. Dates have no explicit display format, so the display preference controls how they appear.

**Try it:** change a quantity or unit price and watch both the invoice amount and the Review sheet update. Select cells to inspect their formulas, or select consecutive rows in the left rail to format them together.

