# Loan Planner
**Acme Manufacturing | equipment financing**

Compare the first year of payments on a fixed-rate loan. The principal, annual rate and term come from Start Here. Payments occur at the end of each month; the bank's charges and fees are not included.

**Try it:** change Loan annual rate to 0.06 in Start Here. The monthly payment and its interest/principal split recalculate immediately. Select a payment to see pmt, ipmt or ppmt in the formula assistant.

| Month | Opening balance | Payment | Interest | Principal | Closing balance |
