A payment is split into interest and principal. Closing balance decreases only by principal. The Review sheet checks the first-year totals using cumulative interest and principal functions.

# Delivery Sessions
**Acme Manufacturing | service delivery log**

Sixteen work sessions include site planning, inspections and customer handovers. Times are recorded in UTC so the overnight shift has an unambiguous duration. Billable sessions use Hourly rate from Start Here.

**Try it:** change a Billable value from false to true. The fee and the service revenue in Review update together. Elapsed is a duration, not a clock time; it can span midnight.

